OL,3,S#######################################
OL,4,CGTA 6 sales hit $3.8bn in a single day 
OL,5,C- the biggest entertainment launch in  
OL,6,Chistory                                
OL,7,GGrand Theft Auto 6 (GTA 6) saw record  
OL,8,Gretail sales in its first full-day of  
OL,9,Grelease, hitting $3.8bn (#2.9bn),      
OL,10,Gmaking it the biggest entertainment    
OL,11,Glaunch in history.                     
OL,13,FTake-Two, the parent company of        
OL,14,FRockstar Games, said on Friday the     
OL,15,Ffigures were based on estimates        
OL,16,Fthrough end of day on Thursday and     
OL,17,Fmarked a record for "entertainment     
OL,18,Facross any medium". It pre-sold 32.5m  
OL,19,Fcopies of the game.                    
OL,22,C]DTV    520  Lottery   555  Music 530  
OL,23,C]DFilms 540  Newsround 570  Games 550  
